  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Right now, a person's Account Name or User Name (Not sure what terminology y'all use for it) appears displayed below their current Display Name when looking at a person's profile on the website. \nAs there is no way to change this name, it represents an uncontrollable vector for harassment, as many people share the same username for VRC as they do for many other services. With no way to change or hide it, it would be trivial for a harasser to stalk a user to other sites for continued harassment. \nWhile allowing this name to be changed may represent a great technical hurdle, simply not displaying it would go a long way to allowing a user to more easily safeguard themselves without having to create a completely new account\nThere are many reasons a player would want to change or hide this data, please either give the option to change or hide, or at the very least disable its revelation by default",
